  "tag": "In Isaac Sim",
  "text": "What if SimReady were also SoundReady? Six objects dropped in Isaac Sim — a socket as hi-hat, a 6 g M8 nut, a plastic crate, a wood pallet, a 62 kg steel drum as the 808 — play a drum kit. PhysX decides when each hit lands and how hard; the metadata decides whether it sounds right.",
